[sliver] The four faces are the two rims of the 0.15 mm running-fit relief where the Y-seam tongue's ceiling meets the upper socket collar on each side. `fits.slip` separates the collar's y=196.850 fore face from the y=197.000 fusion shoulder; the top-wall and tongue sections around that air slit each keep their full 3 mm thickness, so no 0.15 mm ligament is printed.
