[ceiling] The pump-bay lintel is the complete fixed roof at z=283.495. It carries the display/ridge storey and leaves 1 mm above the cartridge crown at z=282.495 for withdrawal. This flat roof is retained as a supported face; a corbel extending into the bay would occupy the cartridge's withdrawal envelope. Support topology and build-up require the production slice for this mesh.
