[sliver] The Micro-Fit fixed housing's cavity-side thinning pocket — its 16 × 14 mm rectangle reduces the 3 mm ridge rib to the specified 2 mm snap-in panel. The reported 1.01 mm faces are the depth walls of that removed pocket, including its 0.01 mm boolean overrun; they bound air, while the printed panel behind them retains its complete 2 mm section.
